Package: diaoptimizer
Title: DIA Isolation Window Optimizer for Mass Spectrometry
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("KBSI", "Proteomics", , "proteomics@kbsi.re.kr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Production-ready R tool for optimizing Data-Independent Acquisition
    (DIA) isolation windows for mass spectrometry. Uses DIA-NN results to generate
    optimized RT-dependent isolation windows specifically for Thermo Fisher Orbitrap
    mass spectrometers. Features include DPPP (Data Points Per Peak) optimization,
    4 m/z strategies (quantile, coverage, outlier, smoothing), technical replicate
    consensus handling, and 22-column Xcalibur-compatible method file export.
